Lastly, we also performed intra-RNA and protein–RNA DEER measurements by introducing spin labels at the 5′- and 3′-termini (see Supplementary Fig. S5B–D for primary DEER data). Unsurprisingly, intra-RNA measurements performed on the spin-labelled RNAs in complex with unlabelled SRSF1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
