\usepackage{upgreek}
\usepackage{mathrsfs}
\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
\begin{document}
$K_\mathrm{d} = 58$\end{document} nM) compared to the concentrations used in our experiments, it is unlikely that the restraint set is affected by a fraction of free proteins or protein where the RNA binds to only one RRM. We conclude that the SELEX restraints are required for arriving at a realistic ensemble model using initial AF3 ensembles. In the RigiFlex initial pool they are fulfilled by construction, as the RRM1/CA pair and the RRM2/GGA pair are treated as rigid bodies.

