$_{\Delta \mathrm{RS}}$\end{document} (blue in Fig. 10) is vacated upon binding of RNA9 (gold). This space corresponds to the top right in the left panel and to the top front in the right panel. For binding of RNA12 such a depopulation of conformational space is less evident (Fig. 10B). The newly occupied space is on the left in the left panel and on the right front in the right panel.

